keynet-v4.onnx - Betterfy key v4 model weights

Trained for Betterfy (scripts/audio-dsp/keynet-train.py, exported by
keynet-export.py). Architecture after F. Korzeniowski and G. Widmer,
"Genre-agnostic key classification with convolutional neural networks",
ISMIR 2018 (written from the paper; no code or weights from it are used).

Trained on:
  - The Beatport EDM Key Dataset, Angel Faraldo et al., Zenodo record
    1101082, CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://zenodo.org/records/1101082). Only the
    seed-split half A was used for training; half B is held out for testing.
  - The GiantSteps Key dataset annotations, P. Knees, A. Faraldo, P. Herrera,
    R. Vogl, S. Boeck, F. Hoerschlaeger, M. Le Goff, "Two data sets for tempo
    estimation and key detection in electronic dance music annotated from
    user corrections", ISMIR 2015
    (https://github.com/GiantSteps/giantsteps-key-dataset).
No audio from either dataset is included in this file or anywhere in Betterfy.

